				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5509</guid>
				<title>Scp-5509</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5509</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item#: 5509&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Containment class:&lt;/strong&gt; Safe&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; Scp-5509 doesn&#039;t need a special containment since this scp is always calm about his captivity and never attempted any form of escape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; Despite his appearance scp-5509 is calm and only want to know his origins, scp-5509 have some sort of amnesia, don&#039;t remembering anything from his past, just some images and sensations, 5509 is always confused when he sees any animals giving him a headache, also before the first encounter he doesn&#039;t know anything about humans despite knowing elements made by humans.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scp-5509 is a tall humanoid creature with many forms of “scars” in his body, we don&#039;t know for sure if are really scars or is part of the normal body of 5509, his feet ended in a conical form and it seems that doesn&#039;t affect at all his movement, his eyes are big occupying a large portion of the front of the face and also this applies for his mouth, 5509 always have problem closing his mouth consequently giving him a semi-permanent smile, the color of the skin of 5509 is a muddy swampy green, this color is natural on this scp, 5509 have a special ability that is he can concentrate enough heat in his hands to burn something but 5509 say that he doesn&#039;t like to use that, when we asked why he doesn&#039;t like to use the ability he says “&lt;em&gt;I don&#039;t know, just I feel weird when I use it&lt;/em&gt;”.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;DNA test have shown that 5509 doesn&#039;t have human DNA, he has a strange version of DNA of reptiles and unknown DNA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;First encounter with scp-5509:&lt;/strong&gt; One day in Chile many citizens of a city report have been seeing a tall creature roaming around the city, the citizens freak out when they see scp-5509, despite this there&#039;s any report that say that 5509 harm someone, this alarm the foundation who send personnel to capture and bring scp-5509 to the foundation, when they encounter him 5509 doesn&#039;t put any form of resistance and it looked confused and tired, once 5509 was in the foundation he offers the foundation to investigate him saying “&lt;em&gt;I see that you guys are some sort of research facility, you guys can do any form of research on me except if the research include harming me, I don&#039;t know anything of me either, I&#039;m confused about myself&lt;/em&gt;” after this many doctors have been doing research in scp-5509 but no one has determined the origin of scp-5509.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here&#039;s the most important interview realized to scp-5509.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dr. Santdiego here, the foundation have assigning me the task to interview scp-5509 the documents I have read about this scp tell me that scp-5509 is friendly to others, and he never harms someone, the only thing he wants is know his origins and who is him.&lt;br /&gt;
When I enter his room he was waiting patiently in a chair and a table there was another chair, I sit in the chair, and he began to speak.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Hello doctor&amp;#8230;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Santdiego.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Oh Santdiego, good name, they told me that I have an interview today with you, so here you are, you can begin asking yours questions I will answer them all.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First question, do you have any names or some way to refer to you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Umhh&amp;#8230;&lt;/em&gt; (He was silent for a while) &lt;em&gt;now that you tell I remember one, I think my name was “Encantador”, aside that I don&#039;t remember any other except the number the foundation gave me.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;So do you want to be called “Encantador”?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you want.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;So “Encantador” before you were capture by the foundation, What you remember?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;I remember waking up in a strange place, don&#039;t knowing who I am or what was me, but somehow I can speak perfectly and have basic knowledge, next I began roaming around and then I see humans, that was my first time seeing humans and knowing about their existence, I go closer to them to ask any sort of help, but they ran away.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;So are you telling me that you don&#039;t know until that moment about humans?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Yes, but at that moment I already know about the other things in the world and humans was the only thing “new” to me.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;That&#039;s interesting, tell me, do you remember animals?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Yes I remember animals but I feel weird looking at them, like that they&#039;re not how I remember the animals.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Do you have any memories before you wake up in the place.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Yes I remember a laboratory, a female silhouette, a name, I don&#039;t remember the name and a lot of crystal panels.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Do you think you have another type of body in the time before the wake-up?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;No, this body&amp;#8230; I feel that always I have it.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hmmm&amp;#8230; That&#039;s for today, thanks for letting me to do this interview, the information you gave me may be crucial to know yours origins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Thank you doctor.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;End of the interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks to the interview of Dr. Santdiego the foundation can have a better understanding of what can be the origins of scp-5509 aka “Encantador”.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/conmasitco&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7008602&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1605989074&quot; alt=&quot;Conmasitco&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7008602)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/conmasitco&quot;  &gt;Conmasitco&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
