&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;Scenes from a Comprehensive Clusterfuck&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
So, what did you do at work today?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/this-page-intentionally-left-blank&quot;&gt;More by HarryBlank!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
