&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-611105-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. An entire new SI prefix had to be created to quantify SCP-10101&#039;s awesomess.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-611105-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. Measured using special IQ tests that SCP-10101 invented himself.&lt;/div&gt;
